    <string name="autolog_24">Fires a mock payment draft so you can see what the prompt looks like. Nothing is recorded unless you confirm.</string>
    <string name="autolog_25">Trigger a test</string>
    <string name="autolog_26">Detected apps: WeChat, Alipay, Taobao, JD, Meituan, Ele.me and Pinduoduo. For any other app the accessibility detector still tries to read the payment result screen.</string>
